{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","x":-180,"y":-134,"width":360,"height":268,"text":"# Transformer 专题知识导图 · 重点 5\n\n学习目标: 覆盖输入表示、Attention、Encoder、Decoder、训练生成与关键对比\n\n回忆: 能否按输入、注意力、Encoder、Decoder、训练生成解释完整数据流","color":"6"},
		{"id":"input","type":"text","x":320,"y":-1526,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**输入表示** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Token 如何变成带位置信息的向量表示"},
		{"id":"attn","type":"text","x":-640,"y":-1526,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Attention 核心** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Q、K、V 如何计算注意力输出"},
		{"id":"encoder","type":"text","x":320,"y":-68,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Encoder** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Encoder 如何逐层更新序列表示"},
		{"id":"decoder","type":"text","x":320,"y":1390,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Decoder** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Decoder 如何结合已生成内容和源序列"},
		{"id":"training","type":"text","x":-640,"y":86,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**训练与生成** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 训练为什么能并行，生成为什么串行"},
		{"id":"compare","type":"text","x":-640,"y":1390,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**对比与易错** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 三类注意力、BN/LN、训练/推理的关键区别"},
		{"id":"input-token","type":"text","x":800,"y":-2122,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Token 与词表**"},
		{"id":"input-embed","type":"text","x":800,"y":-1834,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Embedding** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 离散 Token 如何变成可学习的稠密向量"},
		{"id":"input-pos","type":"text","x":800,"y":-1383,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**位置编码** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 为什么 Attention 需要位置编码，正弦编码如何表达相对位置"},
		{"id":"input-mask","type":"text","x":800,"y":-910,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Mask** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Padding Mask 和 Causal Mask 分别遮挡什么"},
		{"id":"input-pos-add","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-1506,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**位置向量相加**"},
		{"id":"input-rope","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-1198,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**RoPE**"},
		{"id":"attn-qkv","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-2296,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Q / K / V** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Q、K、V 分别来自哪里，各自承担什么角色"},
		{"id":"attn-score","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-1977,"width":320,"height":114,"text":"**QK^T 与缩放** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 为什么要除以 sqrt(d_k)"},
		{"id":"attn-weight","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-1680,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Softmax 加权汇总** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 注意力权重如何作用到 Value 上"},
		{"id":"attn-multi","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-1218,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**多头注意力** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 多个 Head 为什么要拆分表示空间"},
		{"id":"attn-types","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-756,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**三类注意力** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Self、Masked、Cross Attention 的 Q/K/V 来源和掩码差异"},
		{"id":"attn-proj","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-2276,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**线性投影**"},
		{"id":"attn-head","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-1352,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**子空间**"},
		{"id":"attn-concat","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-1044,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**拼接与输出映射**"},
		{"id":"enc-self","type":"text","x":800,"y":-510,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Self-Attention**"},
		{"id":"enc-addnorm","type":"text","x":800,"y":-222,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Add & Norm** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 残差相加和 LayerNorm 的顺序与作用是什么"},
		{"id":"enc-ffn","type":"text","x":800,"y":86,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**逐位置 FFN** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: FFN 为什么对每个 Token 独立处理"},
		{"id":"enc-stack","type":"text","x":800,"y":394,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**多层堆叠** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 多层 Encoder 输出的表示发生了什么变化"},
		{"id":"enc-ln","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-202,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**LayerNorm**"},
		{"id":"dec-masked","type":"text","x":800,"y":763,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**Masked Self-Attention** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Decoder 如何避免看到未来 Token"},
		{"id":"dec-cross","type":"text","x":800,"y":1082,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Cross-Attention** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Cross-Attention 的 Q 来自哪里，K/V 来自哪里"},
		{"id":"dec-ffn","type":"text","x":800,"y":1410,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Decoder FFN**"},
		{"id":"dec-output","type":"text","x":800,"y":1698,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Linear + Softmax** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 隐藏表示如何变成下一个 Token 的概率分布"},
		{"id":"dec-generate","type":"text","x":800,"y":2006,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**自回归生成** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 生成一个 Token 的完整步骤是什么"},
		{"id":"dec-kvcache","type":"text","x":1280,"y":2006,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**KV Cache** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 推理时缓存什么，为什么不缓存 Q"},
		{"id":"train-teacher","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-376,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Teacher Forcing** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 训练时 Decoder 的输入来自真实标签还是模型预测"},
		{"id":"train-parallel","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-79,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**并行训练 vs 串行推理** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 为什么训练可以一次算完整句，推理却必须逐 Token"},
		{"id":"train-causal","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":260,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**因果掩码**"},
		{"id":"train-decoding","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":548,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**解码策略** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Greedy、Top-K、Top-P 的候选范围如何变化"},
		{"id":"cmp-attn","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":928,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**三类注意力对比** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 输入来源、掩码和计算过程分别有何不同"},
		{"id":"cmp-bnln","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":1236,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**BN vs LN** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 统计维度、batch 依赖和适用场景有什么区别"},
		{"id":"cmp-scale","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":1500,"width":320,"height":224,"text":"**不缩放的问题** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 为什么缩放前点积容易让 Softmax 饱和\n\n现象：注意力分布过尖、梯度变小\n原因：维度增大后点积方差变大\n正确：除以 sqrt(d_k)"},
		{"id":"cmp-residual","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":1872,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**残差连接**"}
	],
